    // directory from [Options.SeedDir] or [SchemaOptions.SeedDir] is used.
    Dir string `yaml:"dir"`
    // Env is the seed environment to apply (for example dev or test). It is
    // required; files matching Env plus files ending in .all.sql are applied.
    Env string `yaml:"env"`
}
    SeedStep applies SQL seed files using the seeder's NNN_description.env.sql
    convention: files matching Env plus files ending in .all.sql are applied
    in version order. Because the target is a throwaway test database,
    protected-environment and protected-table guards do not apply.


